                    1343.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. The University will process the prospective individual salary increases as soon as practicable, but in no event more than ninety (90) calendar days following ratification of the Agreement.",
            "block_bbox": [
                254,
                1367,
                1121,
                1454
