            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. The University will process the retroactive salary increase to be retroactive from the date of processing back to the effective date of the increase (January 1, 2004), in accordance with the provisions of Section A.1, above. The processing shall occur as soon as practicable but not more than one hundred and twenty (120) calendar days following ratification of the Agreement.",
